"Kuruby reviews your prompt before creating an image. If it meets the platform's content requirements, you can continue. Otherwise, please use a different prompt." = "Kuruby 会在生成图像前审核您的提示词。符合平台内容要求后可继续，不符请更换提示词。";
"Kuruby's content review service is unavailable. Please try again before using prompt assistance or generating images." = "Kuruby 内容审核服务不可用，请稍后重试，或在使用提示辅助及生成图像前再次尝试。";
"LaMa Manga and FLUX.2 Klein publish Apache 2.0 terms. AOT GAN's canonical weights use MIT; its ONNX conversion repository does not declare a separate license. RORem combines Apache 2.0 components with an SDXL inpainting base under CreativeML Open RAIL++-M." = "LaMa Manga 和 FLUX.2 Klein 采用 Apache 2.0 许可。AOT GAN 的标准权重使用 MIT 许可；其 ONNX 转换仓库未声明单独许可。RORem 结合 Apache 2.0 组件与 CreativeML Open RAIL++-M 下的 SDXL 修补基底。";
"Local translation models" = "本地翻译模型";
"Native runtimes" = "原生运行时";
"OCR detects text and recognizes the original dialogue on this device. Apple Vision is built in; Manga OCR, Baberu OCR, Hayai OCR and PaddleOCR are optional model downloads." = "OCR 在此设备上检测文本并识别原始对话。Apple Vision 内置；Manga OCR、Baberu OCR、Hayai OCR 和 PaddleOCR 为可选模型下载。";
"OCR models" = "OCR 模型";
"Projects, manga pages and generated images are stored on this device. Translation providers receive extracted text and translation instructions. API keys are stored in Keychain." = "项目、漫画页及生成图像存储于此设备。翻译供应商接收提取文本及翻译指令。API 密钥存储于钥匙串中。";
"Prompt review" = "提示词审核";
"Qwen 3.5 and Gemma 4 catalog models publish Apache 2.0 terms. Follow each model's source card for the downloaded revision and any companion-component terms. Imported models have their own licenses." = "Qwen 3.5 和 Gemma 4 目录模型采用 Apache 2.0 许可。请参照各模型的源码卡查看下载版本及相关组件条款。导入模型拥有独立许可。";
"Reviewing prompt…" = "提示审核中…";
"Source code" = "源码";
"Source code, models and licenses" = "源码、模型与许可证";
"Source-code licenses do not grant additional rights to model weights. Each model publisher's license, copyright notices and usage conditions remain applicable." = "源码许可证并未赋予模型权重额外权利。各模型发布者的许可证、版权声明及使用条件依然适用。";
"This prompt contains restricted content. Please change it before generating an image." = "此提示包含限制内容，请在生成图像前修改。";
"You can decline. Prompt assistance and image generation can continue after you allow prompt review." = "您可以拒绝。允许提示审核后，提示辅助与图像生成可继续。";

"Enter a path on the configured Rawkuma website." = "请输入已配置的 Rawkuma 网站内的路径。";
"Manga path" = "漫画路径";
"This content is inappropriate and cannot be translated." = "内容不适宜，无法翻译。";

"Scanning chapter · page %lld/%lld" = "正在扫描章节 · 第 %lld/%lld 页";

"Sending chapter · %lld text regions" = "正在发送章节 · %lld 个文字区域";

"Chapter queued · %lld text regions" = "章节排队中 · %lld 个文字区域";

"Translating chapter · waiting for the server" = "正在翻译章节 · 等待服务器处理";

"Translating chapter · %lld/%lld regions · batch %lld/%lld" = "正在翻译章节 · %lld/%lld 个区域 · 第 %lld/%lld 批";

"Receiving chapter translation" = "正在接收章节译文";

"This chapter is too large for one server request. Split it into smaller chapters." = "本章内容过大，无法一次发送到服务器。请拆分为更小的章节。";

"Sign in to the backend before using Backend API." = "使用 Backend API 前请先登录服务器。";

"Text regions per batch" = "每批文字区域数";

"Default: 300. Set 100–1,000 text regions per batch. Smaller batches may be used to fit the model's limits." = "默认：300。每批设置 100–1,000 个文字区域。系统可能根据模型限制使用更小的批次。";
